Data files under data/ are NOT covered by either license above. Raw
third-party corpora are excluded from this repository entirely (see
README.md for download instructions and checksums); the essay sets this
project generated itself (data/bedrock_claude_essays.csv,
data/openai_gpt56terra_essays.csv) and the derived RAID subset
(data/raid_abstracts_subset.csv, RAID itself is MIT-licensed) are included
for reproducibility and fall under the same MIT terms as the code.

